# Cloudflare Pages reads this at deploy time and does not serve it.
#
# A ticket board has no reason to be in a search index, and no reason to be framed, sniffed
# or referred out. Everything here is default-deny.
#
# None of this is privacy. If the board has been changed to sign itself in as a shared
# viewer account, anyone with the URL has full access, and noindex only asks search engines
# not to list it. Access control is board_member, enforced by row-level security.

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
